WEBVTT

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.512
because they don't have
to hit, necessarily,

00:05:30.536 --> 00:05:32.045
to do this kind of damage.

00:05:32.069 --> 00:05:34.676
They don't have to do global devastation.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.512
If one of these things were to hit
pretty much anywhere,

00:05:37.536 --> 00:05:38.691
it would cause a panic.

00:05:38.715 --> 00:05:40.980
But if it came over a city,
an important city --

00:05:41.004 --> 00:05:43.268
not that any city
is more important than others,

00:05:43.292 --> 00:05:46.631
but some of them we depend on more
on the global economic basis --

00:05:46.655 --> 00:05:51.861
that could do a huge amount of damage
to us as a civilization.

00:05:51.885 --> 00:05:55.407
So, now that I've scared
the crap out of you --

00:05:55.431 --> 00:05:56.536
(Laughter)

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.537
what can we do about this?

00:05:58.561 --> 00:06:00.648
This is a potential threat.